    "bestPractice": "Always isolate test dependencies, enforce deterministic assertions, and use clear semantic locators/endpoints to keep tag-based test execution in ci resilient against flaky test runs.",
    "pitfallToAvoid": "Never use hardcoded Thread.sleep() or static shared mutable state across parallel test threads when testing tag-based test execution in ci.",
